; ms_bwan_hibana -- the Chain Chomp's mouth sparks (pass 150e). A one-shot SmsFxBurst of short-lived streaks that jet
; DIRECTIONALLY forward out of the mouth (the emitter is spawned facing the Chomp's +Z; direction = local +Z, a tight
; 14-deg cone), each elongated along its own velocity (align_y + a long quad), cooling yellow -> orange as it fades.
; Low explosiveness so there is a continuous jet of streaks at every age rather than one bunched birth-burst. glow1_spark, additive.

